{"seq":7,"slug":"cross-platform-development","title":"跨平台开发","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":6,"docCount":24,"url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development","rating":{"composite":4.46,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.73,"verdict":"consider","uScore":3.75}},"introMarkdown":"# 跨平台开发 简介\n\n跨平台开发是用一套核心技术栈同时覆盖多个操作系统和设备形态的工程实践。它的目标并非简单地\"写一次代码到处运行\"，而是在开发效率、用户体验和长期维护成本之间寻找最优平衡点。当一个产品需要同时触达 iOS、Android、Web 乃至桌面端用户时，为每个平台各维护一套独立代码库的成本会随团队规模和迭代速度呈指数级增长——跨平台方案正是应对这一挑战的系统性回答。\n\n本手册面向已具备至少一个平台原生开发经验、希望拓展跨平台技术视野的工程师。你不需要同时精通所有框架，但理解每种方案的设计哲学、技术边界和适用场景，将帮助你在技术选型时做出更理性的判断。\n\n## 内容结构\n\n第一章**跨平台基础**从架构层面梳理跨平台技术的核心模型。不同的渲染策略、桥接机制与原生通信方式、平台抽象的设计思路——这些底层概念是理解任何具体框架之前必须建立的认知基础。掌握了这些原理，你在评估新框架时就不会被表面的语法差异所迷惑。\n\n第二章**Lynx 框架**聚焦字节跳动开源的新一代跨平台方案。Lynx 采用了独特的多线程架构和自研渲染管线，在性能表现上展现出与原生接近的能力。本章将深入其架构设计、组件体系、样式方案和性能优化策略。\n\n第三章**React Native** 探讨 Meta 主导的这一成熟生态。从全新的 Fabric 架构和 TurboModules 到导航模式与性能调优，本章关注的是 React Native 在新架构时代的工程实践，帮助你理解它如何解决旧架构的瓶颈并释放更大的性能潜力。\n\n第四章**Flutter** 深入 Google 的自绘引擎方案。Dart 语言基础、Widget 组合体系、状态管理范式和 Platform Channels 原生通信——Flutter 选择了一条与其他方案截然不同的技术路线，本章将帮助你理解这条路线的优势与代价。\n\n第五章**桌面跨平台**将视野从移动端拓展到桌面领域。Electron 的成熟生态、Tauri 的轻量级替代方案、WebView 容器化应用以及原生 API 的访问策略——桌面跨平台有其独特的技术约束和用户期望，本章逐一展开分析。\n\n第六章**共享基础设施**关注跨平台项目中与框架无关的工程化问题。代码共享策略、多平台 CI/CD 管道、特性开关体系和崩溃监控与数据分析——这些基础设施决定了跨平台项目在真实团队协作中能否持续高效运转。\n\n## 学习建议\n\n建议先完成第一章的基础概念学习，再根据你的实际项目需求选择一到两个框架章节深入研读。第六章的共享基础设施内容适用于所有跨平台方案，建议在学习具体框架之后通读。跨平台开发的核心能力不在于记住每个框架的 API，而在于理解不同技术决策背后的工程权衡。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cross-platform-fundamentals","title":"跨平台基础","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/cross-platform-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"architecture-patterns","title":"跨平台架构模式","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/cross-platform-fundamentals/architecture-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rendering-strategies","title":"渲染策略","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/cross-platform-fundamentals/rendering-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bridge-vs-native","title":"桥接 vs 原生","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/cross-platform-fundamentals/bridge-vs-native"},{"seq":4,"slug":"platform-abstraction","title":"平台抽象层","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/cross-platform-fundamentals/platform-abstraction"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"lynx-framework","title":"Lynx 框架","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/lynx-framework","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lynx-architecture","title":"Lynx 架构","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/lynx-framework/lynx-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lynx-components","title":"Lynx 组件","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/lynx-framework/lynx-components"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lynx-styling","title":"Lynx 样式","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/lynx-framework/lynx-styling"},{"seq":4,"slug":"lynx-performance","title":"Lynx 性能","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/lynx-framework/lynx-performance"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"react-native","title":"React Native","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/react-native","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rn-new-architecture","title":"RN 新架构","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/react-native/rn-new-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rn-native-modules","title":"RN 原生模块","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/react-native/rn-native-modules"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rn-navigation-patterns","title":"RN 导航模式","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/react-native/rn-navigation-patterns"},{"seq":4,"slug":"rn-performance-tuning","title":"RN 性能调优","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/react-native/rn-performance-tuning"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"flutter","title":"Flutter","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/flutter","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dart-fundamentals","title":"Dart 语言基础","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/flutter/dart-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"widget-system","title":"Flutter Widget 系统","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/flutter/widget-system"},{"seq":3,"slug":"state-management-flutter","title":"Flutter 状态管理","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/flutter/state-management-flutter"},{"seq":4,"slug":"platform-channels","title":"平台通道（Platform Channels）","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/flutter/platform-channels"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"desktop-cross-platform","title":"桌面跨平台","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/desktop-cross-platform","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"electron-architecture","title":"Electron 架构深度解析","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/desktop-cross-platform/electron-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tauri-rust-frontend","title":"Tauri：Rust 后端与 Web 前端","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/desktop-cross-platform/tauri-rust-frontend"},{"seq":3,"slug":"webview-based-apps","title":"WebView 应用架构","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/desktop-cross-platform/webview-based-apps"},{"seq":4,"slug":"native-api-access","title":"桌面原生 API 访问","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/desktop-cross-platform/native-api-access"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"shared-infrastructure","title":"共享基础设施","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/shared-infrastructure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"code-sharing-strategies","title":"跨平台代码共享策略","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/shared-infrastructure/code-sharing-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ci-cd-multi-platform","title":"多平台 CI/CD 流水线","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/shared-infrastructure/ci-cd-multi-platform"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feature-flags","title":"功能开关与渐进式发布","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/shared-infrastructure/feature-flags"},{"seq":4,"slug":"crash-reporting-analytics","title":"崩溃报告与数据分析","url":"/h/mobile/cross-platform-development/shared-infrastructure/crash-reporting-analytics"}]}]}